{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121869","id":4153884592,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc73lz-w","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121869","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121869.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121869.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121869","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121869/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121869/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121869/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7c11edff57badf8bbde9e2c243a9960844096ae1","number":121869,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Editor Settings: Fix crash when setting `3D Navigation Scheme` in Project Manager","user":{"login":"NoNormalDev","id":190293561,"node_id":"U_kgDOC1emOQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190293561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev","html_url":"https://github.com/NoNormalDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121861\r\n\r\n## Why does it crash\r\n\r\nThe shortcuts are not registered in the Project Manager, so when we retrieve the Shortcut via `EditorSettings::get_singleton()->get_shortcut(p_name);`, it returns an empty `Ref`, but we don't check for `null,` so we end up calling `null->set_events(...)`, which crashes in a milion diffrent ways.\r\n\r\n## Fix\r\n\r\nI added two lines of defense:\r\n\r\n1. `NULL` check to `Ref<Shortcut> sc = EditorSettings::get_singleton()->get_shortcut(p_name)`\r\n2. Don't call `_set_shortcut_input` if in the Project Manager\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis only fixes the crash, but not the behavior - key modifiers don't show up in the Project Manager (to be clear: this problem existed before this PR)\r\n\r\n<img width=\"598\" height=\"256\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c2e6e9a4-65cf-453a-a749-e7efc4cb5967\" />\r\n\r\n<img width=\"688\" height=\"262\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/16afa7ba-0218-451f-8e2e-6aa5671bcd7b\" />\r\n\r\nNo AI was used.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","description":"","co